background.tgv is Telegram's default chat wallpaper pattern (the pattern of the Classic theme's default wallpaper,
slug fqv01SQemVIBAAAApND8LDRUhRU), a gzipped SVG. Telegram-iOS downloads it from Telegram's servers; tau bundles the
copy Telegram Desktop ships at Telegram/Resources/art/background.tgv (https://github.com/telegramdesktop/tdesktop,
GPLv3 with an OpenSSL exception).
